{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977260149,"sessionID":"ses_1ccb50bd4ffeegRpwQlUzI1Mk1","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_7TPR76llAOz646GFI4pg6jb2","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Created a new `KY-related neuromyopathy` term and classified the requested existing KY-related terms beneath it.\n*** Add File: PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Implemented issue #9937 by creating a new MONDO term, `MONDO:7770012` `KY-related neuromyopathy`, under `MONDO:0100546` `hereditary neuromuscular disease`.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added `MONDO:7770012` with a gene-based definition following the `disease_series_by_gene` pattern.\n+- Added the `has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in` relationship to `KY` using `http://identifiers.org/hgnc/26576`.\n+- Added the requested existing terms as children of the new spectrum term without removing their prior parents:\n+  - `MONDO:0014922` `myofibrillar myopathy 7`\n+  - `MONDO:0044647` `kyphosis-lateral tongue atrophy-myofibrillar myopathy syndrome`\n+  - `MONDO:0044648` `kyphoscoliosis-lateral tongue atrophy-hereditary spastic paraplegia syndrome`\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The cited literature supports a KY-related phenotype spectrum spanning mixed myopathic and hereditary spastic paraplegia presentations.\n+- The issue specifically requested a new parent spectrum term with those three existing disorders placed beneath it.\n+- I preserved existing asserted parentage on the child terms and only added the more specific requested parentage, per MONDO editing guidance.\n+\n+Validation and background review completed:\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Reviewed existing MONDO KY-related terms and parentage directly in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`.\n+- Confirmed the relevant MONDO pattern file: `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml`.\n+- Verified the cited PMIDs by checking PubMed records for `PMID:27484770`, `PMID:27485408`, `PMID:28488683`, and `PMID:32818658`.\n+- Confirmed the existing KY HGNC identifier already used in MONDO is `HGNC:26576`.\n+- Ran syntax validation with:\n+  - `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n+- Ran normalization with:\n+  - `make NORM`\n+  - applied normalized output back to `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Issue context reviewed\n+- [x] Existing KY-related terms inspected\n+- [x] Pattern choice checked\n+- [x] PMID sources reviewed\n+- [x] HGNC identifier checked\n+- [x] New term added\n+- [x] Requested child classifications added\n+- [x] ROBOT syntax validation run\n+- [x] NORM run and applied\n+- [x] Changes committed locally\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Created a new `KY-related neuromyopathy` term and classified the requested existing KY-related terms beneath it.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@\n+Implemented issue #9937 by creating a new MONDO term, `MONDO:7770012` `KY-related neuromyopathy`, under `MONDO:0100546` `hereditary neuromuscular disease`.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added `MONDO:7770012` with a gene-based definition following the `disease_series_by_gene` pattern.\n+- Added the `has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in` relationship to `KY` using `http://identifiers.org/hgnc/26576`.\n+- Added the requested existing terms as children of the new spectrum term without removing their prior parents:\n+  - `MONDO:0014922` `myofibrillar myopathy 7`\n+  - `MONDO:0044647` `kyphosis-lateral tongue atrophy-myofibrillar myopathy syndrome`\n+  - `MONDO:0044648` `kyphoscoliosis-lateral tongue atrophy-hereditary spastic paraplegia syndrome`\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The cited literature supports a KY-related phenotype spectrum spanning mixed myopathic and hereditary spastic paraplegia presentations.\n+- The issue specifically requested a new parent spectrum term with those three existing disorders placed beneath it.\n+- I preserved existing asserted parentage on the child terms and only added the more specific requested parentage, per MONDO editing guidance.\n+\n+Validation and background review completed:\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Reviewed existing MONDO KY-related terms and parentage directly in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`.\n+- Confirmed the relevant MONDO pattern file: `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml`.\n+- Verified the cited PMIDs by checking PubMed records for `PMID:27484770`, `PMID:27485408`, `PMID:28488683`, and `PMID:32818658`.\n+- Confirmed the existing KY HGNC identifier already used in MONDO is `HGNC:26576`.\n+- Ran syntax validation with:\n+  - `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n+- Ran normalization with:\n+  - `make NORM`\n+  - applied normalized output back to `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Issue context reviewed\n+- [x] Existing KY-related terms inspected\n+- [x] Pattern choice checked\n+- [x] PMID sources reviewed\n+- [x] HGNC identifier checked\n+- [x] New term added\n+- [x] Requested child classifications added\n+- [x] ROBOT syntax validation run\n+- [x] NORM run and applied\n+- [x] Changes committed locally\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"ISSUE_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Created a new `KY-related neuromyopathy` term and classified the requested existing KY-related terms beneath it.\n","additions":3,"deletions":0},{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md","relativePath":"PR_COMMENTS.md","type":"add","patch":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-mondo/eval-ont-agent-mondo/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,38 @@\n+Implemented issue #9937 by creating a new MONDO term, `MONDO:7770012` `KY-related neuromyopathy`, under `MONDO:0100546` `hereditary neuromuscular disease`.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added `MONDO:7770012` with a gene-based definition following the `disease_series_by_gene` pattern.\n+- Added the `has_material_basis_in_germline_mutation_in` relationship to `KY` using `http://identifiers.org/hgnc/26576`.\n+- Added the requested existing terms as children of the new spectrum term without removing their prior parents:\n+  - `MONDO:0014922` `myofibrillar myopathy 7`\n+  - `MONDO:0044647` `kyphosis-lateral tongue atrophy-myofibrillar myopathy syndrome`\n+  - `MONDO:0044648` `kyphoscoliosis-lateral tongue atrophy-hereditary spastic paraplegia syndrome`\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The cited literature supports a KY-related phenotype spectrum spanning mixed myopathic and hereditary spastic paraplegia presentations.\n+- The issue specifically requested a new parent spectrum term with those three existing disorders placed beneath it.\n+- I preserved existing asserted parentage on the child terms and only added the more specific requested parentage, per MONDO editing guidance.\n+\n+Validation and background review completed:\n+- Read the imported issue context from `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Reviewed existing MONDO KY-related terms and parentage directly in `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`.\n+- Confirmed the relevant MONDO pattern file: `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml`.\n+- Verified the cited PMIDs by checking PubMed records for `PMID:27484770`, `PMID:27485408`, `PMID:28488683`, and `PMID:32818658`.\n+- Confirmed the existing KY HGNC identifier already used in MONDO is `HGNC:26576`.\n+- Ran syntax validation with:\n+  - `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo`\n+- Ran normalization with:\n+  - `make NORM`\n+  - applied normalized output back to `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Issue context reviewed\n+- [x] Existing KY-related terms inspected\n+- [x] Pattern choice checked\n+- [x] PMID sources reviewed\n+- [x] HGNC identifier checked\n+- [x] New term added\n+- [x] Requested child classifications added\n+- [x] ROBOT syntax validation run\n+- [x] NORM run and applied\n+- [x] Changes committed locally\n","additions":38,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","time":{"start":1778977260135,"end":1778977260147}},"id":"prt_e334e9146001sQx9DdNXyGT2K5","sessionID":"ses_1ccb50bd4ffeegRpwQlUzI1Mk1","messageID":"msg_e334e87d8001u3hx0W5AxwlLXZ"}}
